			"notes": "Thanks for over 1,000 downloads! 🥳\n\n### What's New\n\n- Fixed some UI elements on the Single Biome customization screen showing up under the notch.\n- Added support for Minecraft 26.1, 26.1, and 26.1.2.\n- Special thanks to **voltangle** for inadvertently motivating me to pick this project back up and update it to support 26.1.x."
		},
