			"notes": "### What's New\n\n- Updated for 26.1.2 with a major internal refactor (hence v1.0.0)!\n- Fixed bug where buttons on the Telemetry screen would show under the screen.\n- Added proper implementation for the Player Reporting screen.\n- Added patches for system toasts that pop-up during gameplay (for e.g. \"Chat messages can't be verified\")."
