			"notes": "### What's New\n\n- 📖 **Book screen support**  \n  In-game books now display properly below the notch.\n\n- 🖥️ **More screen support**  \n  More screens are now supported, including the server select screens!\n\n- 🖼️ **Logo positioning**  \n  The Minecraft logo on the title screen now adjusts to avoid being hidden by the notch to account for extreme scaling settings."
